      "text": "```\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|              SOLAR SYSTEM HABITABILITY MAP                            |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                       |\n|  Sun   Mercury  Venus   Earth   Mars   (Belt)  Jupiter  Saturn  ...  |\n|                          *****   ???              |          |        |\n|                                               EUROPA    ENCELADUS     |\n|                                               Ocean     Plumes        |\n|                                                          *****        |\n|                                             Titan   Ganymede  etc.   |\n|                                             Lakes?  Ocean?           |\n|                                                                       |\n|  HABITABILITY DRIVERS:                                                |\n|  Solar energy   Tidal energy   Radioactive decay   Chemical energy   |\n|  (photosyn.)    (Europa/Io)    (rocky interiors)   (serpentinization)|\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
